L3-FLOW-01.steps:
1. POST /auth/login {employeeCode, Correct123}
2. PATCH /user/change-password {oldPassword, newPassword, confirmNewPassword}
3. POST /auth/login with the OLD password
4. POST /auth/login with the NEW password → GET /me

L3-FLOW-05.steps:
1. POST /auth/login (keep both tokens)
2. GET /me with the access token
3. POST /auth/logout {refreshToken}
4. POST /auth/refresh-token {refreshToken}
5. GET /me with the SAME access token again
